fountain golden elf statue~
   Before you is a large, golden statue of an elf.  The look on his face is one
of pain and horror.  Arrows puncture the sculptured elf's body in at least a
dozen places.  Instead of blood, clear drinking water flows from the elf's
wounds.  The water flows into a large basin in which the elf stands.    
